Modifications in this build (details and file pointers: CHANGES.md):

- User interface in four languages (Simplified Chinese / Korean / Japanese /
  English) with in-app switching: src/i18n_runtime.py, src/i18n_data_ko.py,
  src/i18n_data_en.py, src/i18n_data_ja.py, src/i18n_display.py,
  src/i18n_desc.py; user-visible Chinese string literals of the original
  sources are wrapped in _L() / _LF() calls (594 source files changed in this
  way only).
- New page "Team Simulation (Beta)": src/features/team_simulation/ and
  src/services/team_*.py (reviewed rotations, Esper Cycle reactions,
  transformation-state actions, visit-order planner, explanation panel,
  custom-cycle mode with save / load). Since 2.3.1 it shares arc corrections
  with the Arc Efficiency table (src/services/team_fork_corrections.py): the
  chosen arc reaches the character panel, always-on arc bonuses are counted
  once, and two arcs whose effects the engine cannot price are modelled from
  their description and database values ("Global supplement rule").
- New page "Arc Efficiency Table (Beta)": src/features/arc_efficiency/,
  src/services/arc_efficiency_service.py, arc_efficiency_notes.py and the
  generated precomputed rows arc_efficiency_data.py.
- New "Compare with My Characters" for imported battle reports:
  src/features/battle_report/my_build_comparison.py,
  src/services/battle_import_comparison_service.py.
- Game-folder protection for the 2.3.1 component layout: a d3d12.dll,
  plugin DLL, NTE_Capture.dll or dwmapi.dll in the game folder that cannot be
  identified as a file of this program (for example ReShade installed as
  d3d12.dll, or another mod's dwmapi.dll) is never overwritten or deleted:
  src/services/native_plugin_deployment.py, managed_plugin_cleanup.py,
  component_upgrade_guide.py, work_mode_runtime.py,
  src/integrations/legacy_game_proxy.py,
  src/ui/controllers/native_plugin_deployment_ui.py.
- Python reference arithmetic of the battle-report replay: the Hex (覆纹)
  follow-up copy ratio with Linko's passive is 0.33 instead of 0.30, the value
  the original's documentation gives for its analysis component:
  src/services/battle_special_replay_numeric.py. Results computed by the
  bundled, unmodified analysis component are not affected.
- Adjustments needed by the localisation (fonts, search, button and label
  widths, text comparisons that accept the original and the translated text,
  a cultivation-history check that accepts translated text). Counting the
  items above, 51 original source files contain code changes beyond the
  string wrapping.
- The seven "how to use" tutorial images are replaced by Korean versions:
  config/templates/guide/1.png - 7.png.
- An installer for the modified build and the scripts that produce the
  executable, the installer and the source zip: build_tools/.

Files of the original project outside src/ (main.py, assets, data, native
components, third_party, ...) are not modified and are not part of this
repository; the bundled third-party components listed in the original NOTICE
above are redistributed unchanged inside the installer, under their own terms.
